sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant LF as LoginForm
  participant AC as AuthProvider
  participant API as api/auth
  participant BE as Backend
  U->>LF: submit credentials
  LF->>AC: login(email, pw)
  AC->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>BE: (sets HttpOnly cookie)
  BE-->>AC: { user }
  AC->>AC: setUser(user)
  Note over AC: on app mount, GET /users/me restores session from cookie
  AC-->>U: redirect (LoginPage effect) to "/"
